From a8fbee2312fbce7b985084401968db17866e0747 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack <jack@saltern.studio>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 08:24:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add manual partner payout system

- partners + payouts tables (supabase/migrations/0011_partners_and_payouts.sql)
- adminOnly middleware, gated on existing users.role = 'ADMIN'
- POST/GET /api/partners (admin): create partner (emails payout-details link),
  list partners + payout history, resend link
- POST /api/partners/:id/payouts (admin): records a manual payout after the
  admin has already sent the money, emails the partner a confirmation
- GET/POST /api/partners/payout-details?token=... (public, token-gated):
  partner views/submits their own bank or mobile money details
- frontend: /partner/payout-details (public form) and /admin/partners
  (admin list + record-payout + add-partner UI)
